likes to pull tricks on him, and a bit obsessed too. The other character is Cain. He is serious but gets shy easily. He likes to sleep a lot. They are a couple! You can decide the pose and expression based on the information and references! There are multiple outfits in the folder, you can pick any one of the outfit you’d like to draw them in! If you don't feel comfortable with my request, please cancel I will understand. Thank you for considering my request~\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1AXCQHs2iefDiitRaz6C6f0P73DEdH2Ex   \n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1aw7QehuVGFEb3i7qwj0LmS9TllGELrMr", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@sonne_emb/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3533023, "client_id": 3655366, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7ba09d5b/uploads/origins/16444831-5ffb-4d63-8e9a-09faefb62a07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=64eefa2687e1cdb1ce00a809f0698b04", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7ba09d5b/uploads/origins/16444831-5ffb-4d63-8e9a-09faefb62a07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=64eefa2687e1cdb1ce00a809f0698b04, https://si.imgix.net/7ba09d5b/uploads/origins/16444831-5ffb-4d63-8e9a-09faefb62a07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b56165150e2a441fc45fdcc79f9c9d0b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7ba09d5b/uploads/origins/16444831-5ffb-4d63-8e9a-09faefb62a07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b90132d1869d3e4b9c90ed7d0b75ad29 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7ba09d5b/uploads/origins/16444831-5ffb-4d63-8e9a-09faefb62a07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6695ef35efc33f8a56e26d7e0